{"id":"155000006069","t":"Messaging setup & troubleshoot","c":"48000449584","f":"48000666319","cn":"Integrations","fn":"Facebook Integration (15)","m":"Wed, 20 Aug, 2025 at  4:31 AM","lm":"Wed, 20 Aug, 2025 at  4:31 AM","v":2,"w":159,"html":"\n            <p>This guide will help you connect your <strong>Facebook Page</strong> and <strong>Instagram Business Account</strong> so that you can manage conversations directly from the CRM.</p><p class=\"toc-h\"><strong>TABLE OF CONTENTS</strong></p><ul><li>FB page messaging setup</li><li>Instagram Messaging setup</li><li>Other facebook/instagram related support guides</li></ul>FB page messaging setup:<p>1. Eleva should have access to send message and access message for the page (<a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/settings?tab=business_tools&amp;ref=settings\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.facebook.com/settings?tab=business_tools&amp;ref=settings</a>)</p><div class=\"blk\"><a href=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155046611201/original/560dNU3lKrXB3ADHgcxA9uUfY8O2B6oMvw.png?1747220054\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155051975375/original/YUqz2KdURT-9YHgb010cyxhuZSV0WJ7A0g.jpeg?1755682293\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div><p>2. User account should have full access to page and should have message access. ( Link: <a href=\"https://business.facebook.com/latest/settings\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://business.facebook.com/latest/settings</a>)</p><div class=\"blk\"><a href=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155046618449/original/jD5YyOakvOAc3JTp5SfO-NdLt6qeSc-1vQ.png?1747225602\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155051975374/original/cp0IkVvwNzY-Ovfo4YuShCC4JyALOaiK9Q.jpeg?1755682293\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div><p>3. FB messenger should be enabled in Settings &gt;&gt; Integration &gt;&gt; Facebook card &gt;&gt; Settings</p><div class=\"blk\"><a href=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155046618680/original/fXU2j4i8_yMPm5b_vp4sgqbteIBBnFBnIw.png?1747225743\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155051975370/original/ubh0Lx2BwLcsbdL_e6QNzWcPkwidz_0A-Q.jpeg?1755682293\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div><div class=\"blk\"><a href=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155046618711/original/Kw8mxcMbUAe45MoZsidRgdE5GNORLGLDdg.png?1747225761\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155051975368/original/a41m_xMR_kzMScBsSDM4Ro8SfMgMvXNxPw.jpeg?1755682292\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div><br>Instagram Messaging setup:<p>1. Eleva should have access to send message and access message for the page (<a href=\"https://business.facebook.com/latest/settings\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"></a><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/settings?tab=business_tools&amp;ref=settings\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.facebook.com/settings?tab=business_tools&amp;ref=settings</a>)</p><div class=\"blk\"><a href=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155046611201/original/560dNU3lKrXB3ADHgcxA9uUfY8O2B6oMvw.png?1747220054\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155051975373/original/3e4HfLHBuS2vcIzHqOPPlKkwyYesU5fDKg.jpeg?1755682293\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div><p>2. Verify that you have access to send and receive message on instagram under instagram accounts ( <a href=\"https://business.facebook.com/latest/settings\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://business.facebook.com/latest/settings</a>)</p><div class=\"blk\"><a href=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155046820921/original/tLINkNzirrxoXfTSJdGxULjH4cx8k9f3Ug.png?1747628845\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155051975369/original/nhErqFoGV5OIegyHIHcNcbDrovfqJf9NCQ.jpeg?1755682293\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div><p>3. Verify instagram account is present in connected assets list in the page connected.</p><div class=\"blk\"><a href=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155046820913/original/rThbgLELyFW3QsFfS1WTuVteuNKAyl2-ag.png?1747628832\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155051975371/original/rhD9Rep3yoErxPaN6MV6KiE2NpVJ1UIaRw.jpeg?1755682293\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div><p>4. Instagram messaging is enabled in Settings &gt;&gt; Integration &gt;&gt; Facebook card &gt;&gt; Settings</p><div class=\"blk\"><a href=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155046820968/original/rYafkZPj6wQIXvvuNGOOqY4P2wQWSO_S0Q.png?1747629000\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155051975372/original/DAyCnypW3ZQUyFnsnFIGJUt3SbX3qGNf5w.jpeg?1755682293\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div>\n            \n\n\n\n          "}